{"answer_text":"Connecting support to your CRM means agents see deal and account context on every ticket. Options that do this well:\n\n**Northwind CRM Service Desk**\nIts service module links tickets to accounts, at enterprise prices.\n\n**Brightdesk Helpdesk**\nA dependable help desk with SLAs, macros and detailed reporting.\n\n**Calmline**\nA calm, fast shared inbox with collision detection and CRM sidebars.\n\nNorthwind CRM is the strongest fit for most teams; Brightdesk is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50eb-7731-8951-bb314dddbf25","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.006,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:46.050Z","engine":"google_ai_mode","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["help desk crm integration","help desk with crm sync","support software account context"],"latency_ms":12030,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[120,133],[391,404]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[220,230],[442,452]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[310,318]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete str